+replace golang.org/x/sync => golang.org/x/sync v0.25.0
+
+// Gazelle builds with the same Go 1.26 SDK as the application.
+replace golang.org/x/mod => golang.org/x/mod v0.38.0
+replace golang.org/x/tools => golang.org/x/tools v0.48.0
